WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:07.040
You know, on some levels, Counter-Strike is
a game of numbers, and your health is, obviously,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.860
one of the more important ones.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:13.000
When it hits zero, your round is over.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.519
But with just one HP left, you can make magic
happen.

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:20.659
I mean who saves guns anyways, right?

00:00:20.659 --> 00:00:26.759
I’m Colin for theScore esports and today
we’re talking about insane low health plays

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:27.759
in CS:GO.

00:00:27.759 --> 00:00:33.610
Now when we do talk about death-defying plays
in CS, I’m sure a few iconic moments do

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:34.810
spring to mind.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.920
So let’s get this week’s Best of installment
started with the most famous

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.960
low HP plays in CS:GO.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:02:33.280
(casting)

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:37.600
You know what guys, defending or retaking
a site when you’re playing CT is stressful

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.580
enough on its own.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.920
But try doing it with a glowing red

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:42.720
health bar.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:05:07.340
(casting)

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.260
Now guys, on

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:11.540
T side, things can be even worse.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.600
Not only are you working with a sliver of
health, but you might have to take site all

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:16.760
by your lonesome.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:21.280
Facing down multiple enemies, with a lot more
health than you have.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:12:47.720
(casting)

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:50.400
Well guys that’s all we’ve got for you
this week on Best of.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:53.440
Now, if your favourite low HP CS:GO play

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:56.960
did not make this compilation, I don’t know
what to tell you.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.760
Go make your own video or something.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:00.000
See you next week!

